# Resort sand and teal: a style kit (palette only) that re-skins any program or site built by the architect.

kit resort
name Resort sand and teal
faction none
light fff0c0

panels 12 4 0.15
facade c8b090 f08060 f08060

finish ceramic wall out:render in:plaster
finish ceramic roof roof:slope=rooftile/tile.large

